+    # Nested (no steam): never tag the window with STEAM_GAME/STEAM_BIGPICTURE
+    # or touch opacity. gamescope keys its app/scene handling off those and a
+    # wrong state after the overlay closes leaves the game black. The window
+    # simply maps on top when shown and unmaps when hidden.
     hhd.change_property(display.get_atom("STEAM_NOTIFICATION"), Xatom.CARDINAL, 32, [0])
